                                "sense_id": "513ba798-7fe1-3c17-a732-21f6a56d6ce7",
                                "text": "The Rasenna were to the Romans a foreign nation speaking an unknown tongue.\n[…]\nThe cities of the Rasenna in Campania, whose communications with the mother country, whether by land or sea, were not cut of, surrendered […]."
                            },
